ABILITY:Nature Bond|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Nature's Bond ~ Druid Domain|TYPE:DruidClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.Extraordinary.NatureBond.DruidDomain.CF_Domain|DESC:If choosing a domain, the bear shaman must choose from the Animal, Earth, Protection, and Strength domains.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Bear Shaman|DESC:If choosing a domain, the eagle shaman must choose from the Air, Animal, Nobility, and Weather domains.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Eagle Shaman|DESC:If choosing a domain, the lion shaman must choose from the Animal, Glory, Nobility, and Sun domains.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Lion Shaman|DESC:If choosing a domain, the serpent shaman must choose from the Animal, Charm, Trickery, and Water domains.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Serpent Shaman|DESC:If choosing a domain, the wolf shaman must choose from the Animal, Community, Liberation, and Travel domains.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Wolf Shaman|DESC:You may not choose an animal companion. You must choose the Air or Weather domain, or the Cloud, Storm, or Wind subdomain.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Storm Druid|DESC:A tempest druid may not choose an animal companion, and must instead select a domain when she gains the Nature Bond ability. A tempest druid must choose the Air or Weather domain, the Cloud, Storm, or Wind subdomain, or the Aquatic or Swamp domain.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Tempest Druid|DESC:A tempest druid may not choose an animal companion, and must instead select a domain when she gains the Nature Bond ability. A tempest druid must choose the Air or Weather domain, the Cloud, Storm, or Wind subdomain, or the Aquatic or Swamp domain.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Archetype,Druid Archetype ~ Tempest Druid
USERPOOL:Nature Bond|POOLPOINTS:0.0
